{"id":"9d9b4e06b950da5b","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-uniqueness-classifying-topos.md","title":"Theorem — 分类拓扑斯的唯一性","display":"Theorem — 分类拓扑斯的唯一性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-uniqueness-classifying-topos","aliases":["14-thm-uniqueness-classifying-topos"],"display":"Theorem — 分类拓扑斯的唯一性","depends_on":["[[14-df-classifying-topos]]","[[14-df-category-equivalence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-uniqueness-classifying-topos"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-uniqueness-classifying-topos</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 分类拓扑斯的唯一性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a76b2bc2c7b718cf\" href=\"?note=a76b2bc2c7b718cf\" title=\"14-df-classifying-topos\">14-df-classifying-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c502117a84587a7c\" href=\"?note=c502117a84587a7c\" title=\"14-df-category-equivalence\">14-df-category-equivalence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb T\">\\(\\mathbb T\\)</span> 为有穷几何理论；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_1,\\mathcal B_2\">\\(\\mathcal B_1,\\mathcal B_2\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a76b2bc2c7b718cf\" href=\"?note=a76b2bc2c7b718cf\" title=\"14-df-classifying-topos\">14-df-classifying-topos</a> 的实际泛模型分类性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsClassifyingTopos}(\\mathcal B_1,\\mathbb T)\\land\\mathrm{IsClassifyingTopos}(\\mathcal B_2,\\mathbb T)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal B_1\\simeq\\mathcal B_2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsClassifyingTopos}(\\mathcal B_1,\\mathbb T)\\land\\mathrm{IsClassifyingTopos}(\\mathcal B_2,\\mathbb T)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal B_1\\simeq\\mathcal B_2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：在两个分类等价下分别将对方的泛模型提升为几何态射。复合拉回仍给原泛模型，分类函子的全忠实性给复合与恒等的可逆二胞；两逆像函子因此准逆，给范畴等价。需要 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a76b2bc2c7b718cf\" href=\"?note=a76b2bc2c7b718cf\" title=\"14-df-classifying-topos\">14-df-classifying-topos</a>的泛模型诱导性，不能由点点无关联等价直接推出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-classifying-topos","status":"resolved","id":"a76b2bc2c7b718cf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-classifying-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"c502117a84587a7c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-classifying-topos","status":"resolved","id":"a76b2bc2c7b718cf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb T$ 为有穷几何理论；$\\mathcal B_1,\\mathcal B_2$ 满足 [[14-df-classifying-topos]] 的实际泛模型分类性质。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-classifying-topos","status":"resolved","id":"a76b2bc2c7b718cf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"证明：在两个分类等价下分别将对方的泛模型提升为几何态射。复合拉回仍给原泛模型，分类函子的全忠实性给复合与恒等的可逆二胞；两逆像函子因此准逆，给范畴等价。需要 [[14-df-classifying-topos]]的泛模型诱导性，不能由点点无关联等价直接推出。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_1,\\mathcal B_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsClassifyingTopos}(\\mathcal B_1,\\mathbb T)\\land\\mathrm{IsClassifyingTopos}(\\mathcal B_2,\\mathbb T)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal B_1\\simeq\\mathcal B_2.","display":true}],"bytes":1038,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-285","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-uniqueness-classifying-topos|Theorem — 分类拓扑斯的唯一性]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-79","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-uniqueness-classifying-topos]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-286","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-uniqueness-classifying-topos|Theorem — 分类拓扑斯的唯一性]]"}],"outgoing":["a76b2bc2c7b718cf","c502117a84587a7c"]}